WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
{ED}

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:07.430
To save Candy, the five of us travelled to the Bad End Kingdom,

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.900
but we got into some serious trouble when Emperor Pierrot revived before our very eyes!

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.740
When all seemed lost...

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:21.780
The legendary Pegasus appeared before us, and granted us their power!

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.650
With its help, we defeated Emperor Pierrot!

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:39.530
And so, our tale found its happy ending.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.600
We all live happily ever after!

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.900
Is this the Royal Queen?!

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:48.160
She's huge!

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:52.410
Can you hear us, Royal Queen?

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.040
It appears as though she cannot.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.420
You there?

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.680
Excuse me!

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:00.680
Yahoo!

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:07.500
Isn't the Royal Queen supposed to revive if we collect all the Décors?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.960
Why isn't the Royal Queen waking up, Onii-chan-kuru?

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.700
Well, while I have done quite a bit of reading on the subject-de gozaru, I'm not...

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:20.840
I know! The Queen must not be a morning person!

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:22.540
Kuru?

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:27.310
Oh, I know that feeling! I know I need to get up,

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:30.770
but my bed just feels so comfy, I can't bear to get up!

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:32.510
You've gotta be kiddin'...

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.530
I have an idea-de gozaru!

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:39.250
As you've come all this way to Märchenland-de gozaru, perhaps you should take a look around-de gozaru.

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:40.860
You don't mind?!

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:41.720
Of course not-de gozaru.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:46.030
I'll take you on a tour of Märchenland-kuru!

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:50.440
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.270
Smile Precure!

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.170
Let's go!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.710
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:55.840
All together!

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:57.450
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.650
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:02.320
Smile Precure!

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:07.150
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:12.590
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:17.800
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:23.740
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:28.680
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:28.640
So bright!

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:33.850
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:40.290
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:40.790
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:41.960
Let's go!

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:44.660
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.600
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:52.400
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:52.970
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:54.640
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:55.770
Everybody!

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.440
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.970
Fly to the future!

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:03.480
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.650
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.950
Smile Precure!

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:24.380
One, two, one, two, one, two!

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:25.610
They're so cute!

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:28.310
They're the palace guards-kuru!

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.810
Hi there!

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:33.320
Nice to meet you, we're...

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.250
What did we do?

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:44.100
They've never seen humans before, so they must be terrified-de gozaru.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.710
Ain't much good at defendin' the place then, huh?

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:48.520
Easily scared, huh?

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.480
I must apologize for startling them then.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:54.140
I know! You should just make yourselves into fairies too-kuru!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.740
What do you mean?

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:57.770
I believe she means <i>this</i>-de gozaru....

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.590
We've turned into fairies!

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:13.260
You're so cute, Nao!

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:13.220
That look fits ya to a tee, Reika!

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:14.920
I believe it rather suits you, Akane!

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:14.920
You too, Miyuki!

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:18.430
Let's all say funny things at the end of our sentences!

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.220
You know, like Candy's "-kuru"!

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:24.010
That'd be adorable! I'll go with "Yayo", then, yayo!

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:26.200
And I'll use "Nao", nao!

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.790
You should go for "Ya'll" then, Akane!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.730
That's not funny, ya'll!

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:36.910
I think "indeed" would be good for you, Reika!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.180
Would it, indeed?

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:56.230
Sixteen Décors should have been enough to revive the Royal Queen...

00:04:57.070 --> 00:05:00.970
...so, why didn't they wake her from her slumber-de gozaru?

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:02.610
What do we do now?

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.510
There <i>has</i> to be something...

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:12.680
Pierrot's gone, and we all live happily ever after?

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:15.150
Is it really that simple-de gozaru?

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.390
What a cute little town, yayo!

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:24.390
It's like something from a fairytale, miyu!

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.260
It's not just the town-kuru!

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.910
A red hood...

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.690
Is that Little Red Riding Hood?!

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:36.510
That's right-kuru!

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:40.940
Splish, splosh...

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:43.410
Look! There's a peach floating down the river, miyu!

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.310
It's splishing and sploshing, ya'll!

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.780
This is really getting old... ya'll.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.020
Splish, splosh!

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:51.480
I'm Momotarou, born from a peach!

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.440
It's really Momotarou, miyu!

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:59.830
Get him!

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.070
Open sesame!

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:11.070
It's Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves, miyu!

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:14.510
Märchenland's full of all kinds of fairies-kuru!

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:15.810
It's incredible, miyu!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:16.990
Breathtaking, yayo!

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:18.190
And cute, nao!

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.650
It is splendid, indeed.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:23.120
How long are we gonna have to talk like this, uh, ya'll.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:26.040
I wanna try that spell too, miyu!

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:32.730
Miyuki-chan!

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:42.100
Are you alright, madame-lap?

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.200
Those boots!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:48.180
Are you the cat from Puss in Boots?!

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:01.100
Are you alright{-lala}?

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.560
Wow, mermaids! Thank you so much, yayo!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.680
We're riding the pumpkin carriage, nao! Come on, giddy up!

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:12.520
Somebody save me-turtle!

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:14.070
Hang on!

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:15.890
Hup, ya'll!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.080
Thank you very much-turtle!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:22.150
I'm from the Dragon Court-turtle, and I want to thank you by...

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.210
Taking me to the Dragon Court?!

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.650
...giving you this magic box that makes you old!

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:29.020
I don't think I'm ready for this!

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.520
Was it this gold axe you dropped into the lake? Or this silver one?

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:40.230
I dropped neither, so I find your query puzzling indeed.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:43.970
You are an honest girl, are you not? I shall reward you...

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.020
...with a pat on the head!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.650
A reward, indeed...

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:50.310
Look! It's a house made of sweets!

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:51.910
It looks yummy!

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:54.270
Eat as much as you like-kuru!

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:56.160
It's like a buffet, ya'll!

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.280
It's almost too pretty to eat, yayo.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:00.250
More for me, then, nao!

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:03.420
I didn't mean that!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.340
I want some too, yayo!

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:12.230
Sweet, milky, and just melts in your mouth... delectable, indeed!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.350
I can't reach it-lap!

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.420
Ah, let me get it for you, miyu!

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.500
We turned back?!

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.750
This sure is yummy... yayo?

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:38.590
Here you go.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.530
T-Thank you-lap.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:50.300
These five are the legendary warriors, the Precure-kuru!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:54.000
They've been working hard to bring back the Royal Queen-kuru!

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.670
Precure!

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:57.220
The legendary warriors!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.010
The Royal Queen, you say?

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.080
Here, let's share it-lap!

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.540
Wow, thank you!

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:07.650
There we go...

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.150
This is kind of nice, isn't it?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:13.760
A difference in species is nothing as long as we all meet eye to eye!

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.460
It's a veritable exchange of cultures... indeed.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:18.430
I think ya can drop that now...

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.620
You must be Aladdin, right?

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.340
Yeah.

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:24.630
So, can that magic lamp of yours grant wishes?!

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:26.780
Oh, no, it's just an ordinary lamp...

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:29.830
You'd need the Miracle Jewel to grant wishes...

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:31.310
The "Miracle Jewel"?

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.520
Ah, there you are.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.720
Rise and shine!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.240
Morning, my dears!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.670
Is it morning already...?

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:02.810
That was a good sleep-oni!

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:05.210
What's that you've got-wasa?

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.810
This is Emperor Pierrot.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.950
Why's he stuck like that?!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:14.950
He was but a step away from completing his resurrection,

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:17.590
but then the Precure threw a kink in the works.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.890
Damn those Precure!

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.990
Remember what they did to us?

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:33.100
I hate them-oni!

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.340
Quiet down, now.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:43.050
Those Precure are incapable of truly besting our master.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:48.100
We should focus our efforts on ensuring Emperor Pierrot revives properly and completely this time.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.250
What do you mean-oni?

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:55.190
I'll need you to gather even more Bad Energy than before...

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:58.230
...with these giant noses!

00:10:58.230 --> 00:10:59.970
What are those?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.360
The Precure have gained access to new powers.

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:05.730
This is our means of leveling the field.

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:10.840
I must warn you though, these noses are rather dangerous. Use them with the utmost care.

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:13.550
Leave it to me.

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:18.230
You want Bad Energy? You got it.

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:22.920
And one other thing. I'd like you to search for the Miracle Jewel.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:28.670
Beauty!

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:35.610
Candy!

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.430
So what's this Miracle Jewel?

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:46.640
Come to think of it, that Joker guy was looking for it, too-kuru!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.440
He was?

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:52.810
The Miracle Jewel is a legendary treasure of Märchenland-lap.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:55.580
If you can get hold of it, it can grant any wish-lap.

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:57.710
Really? Anythin' you want?

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:58.550
It can-lap!

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:00.650
That sounds like a treasure indeed.

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.280
We can't let them steal it!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:03.120
Where is it?

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.420
I couldn't tell you-lap!

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:06.820
But it's got to be <i>somewhere</i>-lap!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.480
I wanna see it!

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:11.550
I wouldn't mind a peek either.

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:15.210
Wolfrun!

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:19.970
Why are you here?! I thought we got our happy ending!

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:24.030
You think you're capable of keeping me down?!

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:27.430
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:29.710
...a Bad End!

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:32.520
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:42.860
D-Don't tell me...!

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:43.590
No!

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.560
It's a Bad End zone-kuru!

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.130
I can't go on...

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:57.270
The Bad Energy we gather from the fairies will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot!

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:02.320
Pierrot?!

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:04.550
I thought we already beat Pierrot!

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:09.050
Today marks the start of the true Bad End!

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:12.380
Come on out, Super Akanbe!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:17.190
Super Akanbe!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.300
I don't know about this "super",

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:24.370
but we won't let you take the smiles from Märchenland!

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.170
Let's go, girls!

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:26.600
Right!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:31.570
Ready?

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:34.970
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:35.980
Go!

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:38.730
Go, go!

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:40.480
Let's go!

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:11.700
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:14.500
Cure Happy!

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.220
Dazzling sun!

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.220
Hot-blooded power!

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:23.960
Cure Sunny!

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:29.870
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.840
Cure Peace!

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:38.170
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.470
Cure March!

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:47.480
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:50.230
Cure Beauty!

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:55.220
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:04.970
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:08.840
Candy!

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:10.470
Onii-chan!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:14.340
You were talking about the Miracle Jewel just now, weren't you?

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:15.850
Where is it?

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.680
Why do you want the Miracle Jewel?!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:22.000
Emperor Pierrot is looking for it!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.950
Pierrot wants the Miracle Jewel?!

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.420
So fess up! Where is it?!

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:26.950
We don't know!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.860
And we wouldn't tell you even if we did know!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.430
Really? So much for the diplomatic approach.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.640
Get them, Super Akanbe!

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.800
Super Akanbe!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.010
Happy!

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:44.550
Sunny!

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:47.280
Super Akanbe!

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:48.910
It appears to have powered up!

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.510
This thing's awesome!

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.880
Get them, Super Akanbe!

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:53.550
Super!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:56.320
Super!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.760
Super!

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:00.690
It's so fast!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:02.160
Super!

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.130
How do we fight this thing?!

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:03.960
Super!

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.860
It doesn't leave any openings...

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.270
Super!

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.730
What the heck are you doing?!

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:12.150
Alright, let's try...

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.140
Akanbe!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:16.330
Precure...

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.160
Happy...

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.140
Shower!

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:27.140
Super Akanbe!

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:28.550
N-No way!

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:31.120
Alright, my turn!

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.800
Precure...

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.970
Sunny Fire!

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:40.330
Akanbe!

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:41.530
What the heck?!

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.140
Akanbe!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:52.480
Super Akanbe!

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:01.580
Super Akanbe!

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.660
It's... so strong...

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:09.130
It far surpasses the previous Akanbes...

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:11.860
That thing <i>is</i> really dangerous...

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.860
I'd better be careful, or it'll take me out too...

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:20.370
The Precure...

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.740
They're in real trouble-de gozaru!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.210
Who cares what happens to us...?

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.810
Why should we even bother...?

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:26.640
It doesn't matter...

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:28.110
What difference does it make...?

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.150
They're all...

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:36.120
Who needs stories with happy endings?!

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:38.620
Märchenland's gonna end right now!

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:40.790
I don't... think so!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:44.590
Not while <i>we're</i> around!

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:48.830
Yeah! This place is too damn amazin' to let you end it all!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:53.150
They might be timid, but everyone here is so nice and friendly!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:56.700
You think we'll stand by and watch them suffer like this?!

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:59.740
Märchenland can do without your bad ending!

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:04.210
Cut the bravado. There's nothing you can do stop it!

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:06.840
Märchenland has us... and we will...

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:08.320
...protect it!

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:13.560
These things?

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:14.190
They're back!

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:17.130
I knew it! They're the legendary Princess Candles!

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:18.590
Princess Candles?

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:21.560
Get them, Super Akanbe!

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:25.070
Super Akanbe!

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:32.220
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:48.790
Princess Happy!

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:50.990
Princess Sunny!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.200
Princess Peace!

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:55.400
Princess March!

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.600
Princess Beauty!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:05.660
Precure: Princess Form!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:15.720
May the light of hope shine!

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:18.990
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.710
Precure...

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:29.400
Rainbow...

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:32.470
Burst!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:40.470
Akanbe...

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:48.630
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:00.170
It keeps happening!

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:05.110
The Precure saved us! Hooray!

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:08.340
Look! It gave us two Décors!

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:11.400
So that means there are more than sixteen Décors!

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:14.180
Let's put them in the Décor Decor-kuru!

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.590
Can you hear me, Precure...?

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.280
Who's there?

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:22.020
That's the Royal Queen-de gozaru!

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:28.560
Thank you for coming to see me, Precure.

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:30.090
Is that the Queen?

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:31.360
Are you awake now?

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:33.870
I have not yet garnered the power to awaken.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:36.570
I am communicating with you all via telepathy.

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:42.480
We gathered the Décors for you, Royal Queen, so why have you not awakened-de gozaru?

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:46.710
I thank you for the Décors you acquired for me,

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:52.450
however, their power was barely enough to summon the pegasus to your aid.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:57.360
You gave us that power then, Royal Queen?!

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:04.030
Does this mean that if we are to revive you, we'll need to collect even more Décors?

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:05.160
Yes...

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.960
I see now-de gozaru.

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:08.600
Is Pierrot still alive-kuru?

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:12.230
It is faint, but I can still detect traces of Pierrot...

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:16.570
I suspect he is gathering his strength before his ultimate resurrection...

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:17.970
His ultimate resurrection...

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:20.040
Then this ain't over yet, huh?

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:23.750
Those Super Akanbes were really strong, too...

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:26.540
It seems we have a long road ahead of us...

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:28.250
We'll be alright!

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:35.150
As long as we stick together, we can beat whatever they throw at us!

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:36.630
Miyuki...

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:38.190
She's right!

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:39.630
I couldn't do it alone, but...

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.700
Together, we shall persevere!

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:45.460
Don't worry, Royal Queen! We'll save you!

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.180
Thank you all so much...

00:21:48.650 --> 00:21:50.360
Well, let's go!

00:21:50.360 --> 00:21:51.130
Bye bye!

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:52.350
See you again!

00:23:39.570 --> 00:23:41.570
It's finally summer vacation!

00:23:41.570 --> 00:23:42.670
That means one thing: the beach!

00:23:42.680 --> 00:23:44.240
We can swim in the ocean together!

00:23:44.240 --> 00:23:45.440
Sounds fun!

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:47.190
Come get your okonomiyaki!

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:48.770
How about a refreshing snowcone?

00:23:48.770 --> 00:23:50.570
Let's see who makes the most sales, Nao!

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:52.020
Bring it on!

00:23:52.190 --> 00:23:53.650
What are you two doing?!

00:23:53.650 --> 00:23:54.920
Let's play over there, Candy!

00:23:54.920 --> 00:23:56.240
{Kuru!}

00:23:56.580 --> 00:23:57.890
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.110 --> 00:24:04.440
Find your ultra happy smile!
